    "title": "Overturned 18-wheeler causing traffic delays on Highway 20 West in Decatur - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Logan Sparkman No media credit provided. ,\n1 days ago DECATUR, Ala. (WHNT) — Decatur Police said an overturned 18-wheeler is causing delays in the westbound lanes on Highway 20.\nPolice responded to the wreck on Tuesday afternoon. According to DPD, there were no injuries reported.\n(Photo: Decatur Police Department) One westbound lane is closed at this time. DPD said drivers can expect delays.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WHNT.com.",
